    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The images shown on the Steam page are placeholders and will be updated as development progresses!</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Feed &amp; Digest</strong> <br>Fuel your energy: eat seafood, nap, or poop to avoid fainting and food comas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc1f Edible Ammo</strong><br>Devour or launch seafood to heal yourself or KO opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Weapon Crafting</strong>  <br>Forge seafood launchers from trash\u2014straws to 3D-printed cannons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267b\ufe0f Eco Bar</strong><br>Collect recyclables to fill your Eco Bar, earning shop discounts and delaying predator attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udebf Bird Support</strong>  <br>Feed and command seabirds to blind foes with aerial poop drops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd88 Predator Vulnerability</strong><br>Faint or coma and face ambushing predators or a last-chance Kraken duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc0b Whale Train</strong><br>Ride whales\u2014blowholes and tails launch you, but stray into their mouths to be swallowed and spat out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddca Shrinking Arena</strong> <br>Melting ice, toxic seas, and choking air close in\u2014last penguin standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And MUCH more to come! \ud83d\udc27</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The images shown on the Steam page are placeholders and will be updated as development progresses!</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Feed &amp; Digest</strong> <br>Fuel your energy: eat seafood, nap, or poop to avoid fainting and food comas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc1f Edible Ammo</strong><br>Devour or launch seafood to heal yourself or KO opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Weapon Crafting</strong>  <br>Forge seafood launchers from trash\u2014straws to 3D-printed cannons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267b\ufe0f Eco Bar</strong><br>Collect recyclables to fill your Eco Bar, earning shop discounts and delaying predator attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udebf Bird Support</strong>  <br>Feed and command seabirds to blind foes with aerial poop drops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd88 Predator Vulnerability</strong><br>Faint or coma and face ambushing predators or a last-chance Kraken duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc0b Whale Train</strong><br>Ride whales\u2014blowholes and tails launch you, but stray into their mouths to be swallowed and spat out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddca Shrinking Arena</strong> <br>Melting ice, toxic seas, and choking air close in\u2014last penguin standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And MUCH more to come! \ud83d\udc27</p>",
